    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/feldenergy-gmbh/finance-analyst-erneuerbare-energien-weissenburg-in-bayern-252284> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-fleet-managerin-berlin-354746> a prov:Entity,
