    schema:datePosted "2026-08-20"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "Zeeco fosters a robust work environment where employees, from engineering teams to support groups, benefit from a strong culture, trained leadership, and opportunities for growth. Zeeco collaborates with the biggest names in the industry, enabling individuals to broaden their skills alongside teams of subject matter experts. Zeeco is a global leader in combustion and environmental solutions, renowned for our expertise in designing, engineering, and manufacturing advanced burners, incinerators, and environmental control systems. Serving a wide array of industries such as oil and gas, petrochemicals, and power generation, we deliver innovative technologies that enhance operational efficiency, safety, and environmental compliance. Are you a recent engineering graduate ready to launch your career in a fast-paced, global environment? At Zeeco, we don’t just build combustion systems—we build futures. Our culture is grounded in integrity, innovation, and collaboration, and we’re looking for bright minds to help us shape the future of clean combustion. Key responsibilities: As a Graduate Applications Engineer, you’ll join our Combustion Rental and Rapid Response team, gaining hands-on experience across technical design, client engagement, and project delivery. You’ll be supported by experienced mentors and work closely with teams across Europe and the USA. Learn and Lead: Develop technical and commercial proposals for combustion rental and flare projects. Design with Purpose: Perform process design to select the right equipment for each client’s needs. Engage Globally: Attend meetings and site visits across Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. Collaborate Across Borders: Work with our UK team, European offices, and US headquarters. Grow Your Skills: Write formal quotations, manage correspondence, and support project progression. Skills and experience required: Educated to degree level in an Engineering discipline (Chemical Engineering an advantage) Passionate about the energy, oil & gas, or chemical process industries Curious, proactive, and eager to learn from real-world engineering challenges A confident communicator with strong written and verbal skills Comfortable reading engineering drawings and using tools like Excel and Word Willing to travel internationally and work at heights when needed Holder of a full UK driving licence Why join Zeeco? At Zeeco, we value our employees and are committed to offering a comprehensive benefits package to support your well-being and professional growth, see below some of the great things we offer: BUPA, Medicash, Employee Assistance Program to support your wellbeing. 12% Employer contribution to company pension scheme to help you plan confidently for the future. 27 days holiday (plus bank holidays)so you can recharge and maintain a healthy work–life balance. Life insurance for added peace of mind. Professional growth opportunities, including training, development, and the chance to work alongside world class engineering teams. A supportive, safety driven culture where your expertise is valued and your voice matters. Regular social events to have fun, and enjoy team camaraderie and to promote and protect our culture Why Zeeco? Work in a culture that values safety, sustainability, and continuous improvement Receive mentorship and training to accelerate your development Travel internationally and gain exposure to diverse engineering environments Join a team that celebrates teamwork, initiative, and technical excellence Ready to kickstart your engineering career with impact? Apply now and become part of Zeeco’s mission to deliver rapid, reliable, and responsible combustion solutions Working at Zeeco means being part of a people-centric culture and environment built on mutual respect, personal encouragement, professional integrity, and limitless opportunity. Join Zeeco and embark on a fulfilling journey where innovation, collaboration, and personal and professional growth converge. Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
