            schema:name "Berlin" ] ;
    schema:title "Junior QA Engineer (m/f/x)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/progyny-global/junior-qa-engineer-berlin-439004> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-junior-research-consultant-im-bereich-marktforschung-wmd-berlin-39323> a prov:Entity,
