            schema:name "DE Remote" ] ;
    schema:title "Operations Manager:in Baustellen (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/enpal/operations-managerin-baustellen-berlin-351197> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-partnership-account-manager-uk-london-125510> a prov:Entity,
