    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/gus/remote-senior-erp-consultant-finance-182474> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-remote-senior-full-stack-developer-480909> a prov:Entity,
