    schema:title "Senior Account Manager / Senior Kundenberater (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/cmf-advertising-gmbh/senior-account-manager-senior-kundenberater-oberursel-475700> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-senior-accountant-gl-accounting-berlin-145703> a prov:Entity,
