    schema:datePosted "2026-08-20"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><h3><strong>About Staffbase</strong></h3> <p>We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first <strong>AI-native Employee Experience Platform</strong>. Our<strong> industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels</strong> - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.</p> <p>Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.<br>We are proud to be a&nbsp;<strong data-stringify-type=\"bold\">Unicorn</strong>&nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.</p></div><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">We’re looking for an experienced Senior Fullstack Engineer to join a newly formed team at Staffbase that builds custom solutions — extending the functionality and capabilities of our award-winning employee communications platform to meet real customer needs. You’ll own solutions from beginning to end: shaping use cases together with stakeholders, building them across the stack, and validating them with the people who use them. You’ll also help bring structure to a growing team of mid-level engineers and mentor them along the way. We’re looking for empathetic, motivated team players who are driven by ownership and growth. Let’s talk!</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>As part of our tech stack, we use: </strong>React.js, TypeScript, JavaScript, Node.js, Kotlin, Go, Java, MongoDB, REST APIs &amp; SDKs, Docker, Terraform, Selenium and Cypress, to name a few.</span></p> <h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Our environment</strong></span></h2> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Working with skilled and like-minded professionals in a team that values diversity and inclusivity</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">We aim to create a flexible and agile work environment that promotes the well-being and work-life balance of our employees</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">We believe that team events during working hours play a vital role in building an exceptionally effective team, and we encourage them</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">We are enthusiastic about technology and committed to using it to improve the world</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">We follow the “You build it, you run it” approach and take pride in it</span></li> </ul> <h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>The team</strong></span></h2> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">You’ll join a newly formed team dedicated to building custom solutions that extend the Staffbase platform for our enterprise customers. We turn specific customer needs into reliable, scalable extensions — widgets, plugins, and integrations — that make our product work exactly the way each customer needs it to.</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Because the team is new, there’s real room to shape how we work: to set engineering standards, bring structure to our processes, and grow together. That’s where you come in.</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>What you’ll be doing&nbsp;</strong></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Own the development of custom solutions end-to-end — from technical design through implementation, testing, and release</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Partner with stakeholders (customers, consultants, and internal teams) to define and detail use cases before development, then validate solutions and gather feedback afterward</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Build across the stack: customer-facing UI in React and TypeScript, backend services, and integrations with Staffbase and third-party APIs</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Mentor mid-level engineers and help bring structure, engineering standards, and good practices to a newly formed team</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Work in a cross-functional, agile setup and produce high-quality, well-tested code</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Give and receive valuable feedback in our code review process, and continuously learn and share knowledge with your peers</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Work iteratively — pushing code frequently, keeping a healthy CI/CD pipeline, and automating where it helps</span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>What you need to be successful&nbsp;</strong></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Solid professional experience (typically 5+ years) as a fullstack developer, including working within engineering teams and owning solutions from concept to delivery</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Strong frontend skills with React.js, TypeScript, and JavaScript, paired with solid backend experience (e.g. Kotlin, Java, or Node.js)</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Confidence working with REST APIs and SDKs, and integrating with external systems</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Experience mentoring or guiding less-experienced developers, and a knack for bringing structure to how a team works</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Comfort working directly with stakeholders — you can translate business needs into technical solutions and validate them afterward</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">A strong focus on quality, clean code, testing, and continuous learning</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Fluent written and spoken English and German — both are required, as you’ll work closely with German-speaking stakeholders and customers in the region</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">A self-starter who works well both independently and as part of a team</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">You understand and appreciate diversity and inclusivity in the workplace<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></li> </ul> <h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Nice to have</strong></span></h2> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Experience with Go, MongoDB, Docker, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions, Terraform, Prometheus or Grafana</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">A background in professional services, consulting, or building custom, customer-facing solutions</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Enterprise integration concepts such as SSO, SAML, OIDC, or SCIM</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">A good understanding of REST and microservices architecture</span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>What you'll get</strong></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><em>Competitive Compensation</em> - we offer attractive salary packages including LTIP (unit-based Long Term Incentive Plan)</li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em>Flexibility </em>- we offer flexible working time models and the option of hybrid work, and support this with a yearly flex work allowance of €1560</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><em>Recharge</em> - with 31 vacation days annually (incl. one floating holiday), plus pro rata fully paid Fridays off during August</li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em>Support</em><strong> </strong>-<strong> </strong>we offer offering a company pension scheme</span></li> <li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><em>Volunteers Day</em><strong> </strong>- you’ll get one day off per year for supporting a social project</span></li> </ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><h3><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/kIbq0q5\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></strong></h3></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
