    schema:title "(Senior) Technical Product Manager (w/m/d) - B2B Saas I Berlin (hybrid)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/packmatic/senior-technical-product-manager-b2b-saas-i-berlin-hybrid-345516> .

