    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/algo1/software-engineer-platform-london-285809> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-software-engineering-consultant-2026-27-graduate-berlin-305630> a prov:Entity,
