    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "team-lead-commercial-partnerships-uki-london-294037" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-08-20"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "Build with us Since 2004, we've had one clear goal: to make payments and money management effortless for every business in Europe. Today, more than 300,000 companies use Mollie to get paid, manage money and grow – with products designed to be simple, scalable, and dependable. With 950+ Mollies across 14+ locations, we care deeply about autonomy and craft. So we work in small teams, with real ownership, and we trust you to make the right decisions. We're building for the long term, so we provide the tools you need, processes you can rely on, and a balanced work environment to help you do work you're proud of. Sound like your kind of place? Let's build together. Your impact Partnerships are at the core of how Mollie goes to market. The partners you manage directly enable new products, new markets, and better experiences for hundreds of thousands of businesses across Europe. As Team Lead, Commercial Partnerships UK, you are the strategic lead for our UK&I Channel Partners. You’ll lead a high-impact team of three, blending people leadership with hands-on commercial execution. This is a high-velocity environment where you’ll identify key partners, grow our ecosystem engagement, and maintain the momentum that keeps Mollie ahead. Reporting to the Director of Commercial Partnerships, you’ll be at the center of our most ambitious scaling initiatives. This is a role with real ownership and real visibility. As Team Lead Commercial Partnerships, you'll work closely with senior stakeholders and help build a partnership function that's built to last. What you'll ship Lead, coach, and develop a high-performing partner sales team of 3, with clear priorities, strong execution, and individual growth Own and strengthen relationships with partners across UK&I, including managing stakeholders, negotiations, and escalations with confidence Collaborating with sales and marketing leadership to build the strategy for merchant acquisition via Partners for the UK market, demonstrating solid commercial acumen, clear business judgment, and an awareness for the whitespace opportunities Maintain team momentum and continuity across key commercial priorities during a critical period of growth for Mollie, as we complete our integration of GoCardless Being accountable for creating pipeline, owning a partner marketing budget to acquire new partners and activate existing partners What you'll bring 2–4+ years of people management experience, including coaching, performance management, and developing team members Proven experience managing partners to drive commercial success, with strong stakeholder management in an international setting A background in financial services, payments, fintech, or ecommerce: you understand the environment and can hit the ground running Commercial negotiation experience, including preparing business cases, deal review materials, and approval documentation for senior sign-off Strong analytical capability, comfortable working with net revenue projections, driving a performance culture and a holding team accountable to targets Grow your way At Mollie, growth is personal. We believe everyone should have the chance to develop their skills, explore new challenges and shape their career on their own terms. You'll get regular feedback and performance reviews to support your development, with fair and transparent salary reviews along the way. Many Mollies move into new roles or take on new projects to stretch themselves, and we actively hire from within to help you take the next step. No matter if you're aiming for promotion, exploring a different career path or building new skills, you'll be supported with the tools, trust and opportunities to grow your way. Unlock your full potential and join us to eliminate financial bureaucracy If you're excited by the idea of building what's next, for yourself and for thousands of businesses across Europe, we'd love to hear from you. Apply with your CV (in English) using the form below. Want a peek behind the scenes? Check out what life at Mollie is really like. AI at Mollie We believe in Always Be Shipping, and AI brings that philosophy to life across every team, every role, every day AI is core to how we build. It helps us move faster, simplify work and make smarter decisions, creating real impact for the businesses we serve. We're looking for people who are excited to use AI to shape the future of finance with us. Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:employmentType "Full Time" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-mollie ;
    schema:identifier "arbeitnow-team-lead-commercial-partnerships-uki-london-294037" ;
    schema:jobLocation [ a schema:Place ;
            schema:name "London" ] ;
    schema:title "Team Lead Commercial Partnerships UK&I" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/mollie/team-lead-commercial-partnerships-uki-london-294037> .

