            schema:name "Cologne" ] ;
    schema:title "Tech Lead AI Engineering (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/nejo/tech-lead-ai-engineering-cologne-148039> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-technical-accounting-expert-berlin-298284> a prov:Entity,
        schema:JobPosting ;
    dcterms:source <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/source/arbeitnow> ;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-08-20T20:33:44+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/enpal/technical-accounting-expert-berlin-298284> ;
    kgjobs:active true ;
    kgjobs:canonicalFingerprint "ab03ac62781bb800e7eb5e136cf383836be186de078807e2bd591fde2edd76c4" ;
    kgjobs:classification "not_match" ;
    kgjobs:firstSeenAt "2026-08-20T12:57:15+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:lastSeenAt "2026-08-20T20:33:44+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "technical-accounting-expert-berlin-298284" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-08-20"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "Our goal is to have a solar system on every roof, a storage unit in every house, and an electric car in every garage. Enpal makes this possible with an integrated total solution for decentralized energy—from solar systems and battery storage to wall boxes, smart meters, and heat pumps. At the heart of it all is our AI-powered platform Enpal.One+, which intelligently connects thousands of systems and efficiently optimizes electricity procurement and feed-in on the energy market. Are you ready for solutions that are more than just a promise and bring real quality of life to thousands of households every day? What you create at Enpal will deliver clean electricity tomorrow and bring about lasting change in how we use energy. What you’ll do As Technical Accounting Expert (f/m/x), you will take ownership of complex technical accounting matters across the Group, advise senior Finance and business stakeholders, and help shape Enpal’s accounting policies, governance and financial reporting. You take independent ownership of complex technical accounting topics and workstreams, partnering closely with the Head of Technical Accounting and senior Finance stakeholders. You assess new business models, products, transactions and contractual arrangements under IFRS and HGB and develop robust, well-supported accounting conclusions for complex and judgmental matters. You lead the research and assessment of complex accounting topics and prepare high-quality, audit-ready position papers, technical memos and supporting analyses. You act as a trusted accounting advisor to Finance and business stakeholders, translating complex business developments into clear accounting implications and practical solutions. You drive the implementation of technical accounting conclusions into accounting and reporting processes, working closely with GL Accounting, Group Accounting, ERP, Tax, Legal and other relevant functions. You shape and further develop Group accounting policies, guidelines and governance and ensure their consistent application across the organization. You monitor developments in IFRS and HGB, assess their impact on Enpal and lead or support the implementation of new accounting requirements. You provide technical expertise on complex areas such as revenue recognition, leases, financial instruments, provisions, consolidation and business combinations, and represent Technical Accounting in discussions with external auditors and other stakeholders. You contribute to strengthening technical accounting expertise across the organization through knowledge sharing, training and guidance on complex accounting matters. What you’ll bring You have a degree in Accounting, Finance, Business Administration or a comparable field and several years of senior-level experience in Technical Accounting, Accounting Advisory, Group Accounting or Audit, ideally in a complex international organization. You have excellent knowledge of IFRS and HGB and strong practical experience applying accounting standards to complex and judgmental transactions. You have a proven track record of independently developing accounting conclusions and preparing high-quality technical accounting papers, assessments and audit documentation. You are highly analytical and can quickly understand complex business models, contracts and transactions and translate their economic substance into appropriate accounting treatment. You combine deep technical expertise with a pragmatic and implementation-oriented mindset and can drive accounting conclusions through to operational implementation. You are comfortable taking ownership of complex topics, challenging existing approaches and influencing stakeholders across Finance and the wider organization. You communicate complex accounting matters clearly and convincingly to both accounting specialists and senior non-accounting stakeholders. You communicate confidently in English; German is a strong advantage, particularly for HGB-related topics and statutory audits. A professional qualification such as ACCA, CPA, Wirtschaftsprüfer or equivalent is a plus. Are you interested even if you don't meet all the requirements? Apply anyway! We look forward to discovering your potential, regardless of whether your experience meets every single requirement. ☀️ What we offer Work at Germany's first green unicorn - Play an active role in shaping the solar energy transition. The sun shines all over the world - At Enpal, you'll work with a highly motivated, diverse team of over 65 nationalities. The ideal setup for your focus - We are convinced that excellent results are achieved when the conditions are right. That's why we rely on a hybrid working concept that gives you the freedom to always work in the way that best suits your tasks. Do you need new inspiration on an international level? With Workflex, we offer you the opportunity to relocate abroad for up to 30 days a year, depending on your responsibilities. Grown-up business & startup spirit - In our modern office in Berlin-Friedrichshain, you'll find everything your heart desires, from height-adjustable desks and table tennis to stocked beverage fridges and barista coffee. Your kick-start at Enpal - Onboarding day with a welcome bag, buddy program, and a team that really supports you. Stay up to date & help shape the future - Transparent all-hands meetings, short decision-making processes, and an open feedback culture - without mistakes, there is no progress. The energy transition can only be achieved together - At Enpal, you can expect legendary team spirit and unforgettable team events. Your extra boost - 29 vacation days + one additional day off on Christmas Eve and New Year's Eve, discounted membership at Wellhub, and corporate benefits. Everything you need to help you achieve a good work-life balance. At Enpal, we are proud of the diversity of our team. No decisions are made on the basis of skin colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability or age, either during recruitment or employment. Enpal stands for a safe workplace and takes action against discrimination and harassment of any kind. Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:employmentType "Full Time" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-enpal ;
